COLORSYNC.DISPLAYSERVICES(8)                           System Manager's Manual

NAME
     colorsync.displayservices – ColorSync Display Services

SYNOPSIS
     colorsync.displayservices

DESCRIPTION
     colorsync.displayservices provides services for SkyLight framework
     (WindowServer) and loginwindow.

     There are no configuration options for the colorsync.displayservices
     agent.  One should not run colorsync.displayservices manually.

